"title": "Download the Official Fan Kit",
"utc": "2021-07-07T00:00:00Z",
"body": "The world of Pywel — in a kit. To all those who are planning on creating Crimson Desert content, this one’s for you!\nGet a deeper look into the world of Crimson Desert and boost your content creation with this new Fan Kit, containing high resolution screenshots of Pywel (including brand new screenshots from 2020 which we’re revealing for the very first time, like the ones below), image resources, and game-related info.\nAs always, thank you for your continued support and for the great Crimson Desert content you’re putting out there. We’ll be updating this kit periodically in order to bring you all the latest on Pywel, so keep an eye on Crimson Desert’s official social media for fan kit-related news!\n![](https://s1.pearlcdn.com/crimsondesert/staticUpload/Board/3155828680e20210712084239227.jpg)\n![](https://s1.pearlcdn.com/crimsondesert/staticUpload/Board/4ae3a396fb920210712084250292.jpg)\n[![](https://s1.pearlcdn.com/crimsondesert/staticUpload/Board/db76f5a2bd120210712090539247.jpg)](https://s1.pearlcdn.com/cd/contents_cd/files/fankit_241206.zip)\n* By using the contents of this Crimson Desert Fan Kit, you agree to Pearl Abyss’ [Fan Content Guidelines](https://crimsondesert.pearlabyss.com/Policy/policy/index/?policyNo=2).\n\n### ● Join us on:\n\n» YouTube: [https://youtube.com/crimsondesert](https://www.youtube.com/crimsondesert)\n» Twitter: [https://twitter.com/crimsondesert_](https://www.twitter.com/crimsondesert_)\n» Discord: [https://discord.gg/crimsondesert](https://discord.gg/crimsondesert)\n» Facebook: [https://facebook.com/crimsondesert](https://www.facebook.com/crimsondesert)\n» Instagram: [https://instagram.com/crimsondesert_](https://instagram.com/crimsondesert_)"
