"utc": "2020-12-18T00:00:00Z",
"body": "The gameplay trailer for Crimson Desert recently premiered at The Game Awards 2020.\nWe would like to give our thanks to gamers across the world for their interest in our latest gameplay trailer.\nFor those of you interested in learning more about the trailer, we prepared a special video that will give you behind-the-scenes insights on what to expect from the game.\nFind out more in Crimson Desert Dev Archives: Trailer Commentary.\nIn the video, Daeil Kim, the Executive Producer of Crimson Desert, walks you through the secrets behind the recently revealed Crimson Desert gameplay trailer.\n(There’s a hidden scene at the end of the video, so be sure to watch it to the end!)\n\n### ● Join us on:\n\n» YouTube: [https://youtube.com/crimsondesert](https://www.youtube.com/crimsondesert)\n» Twitter: [https://twitter.com/crimsondesert_](https://www.twitter.com/crimsondesert_)\n» Discord: [https://discord.gg/crimsondesert](https://discord.gg/crimsondesert)\n» Facebook: [https://facebook.com/crimsondesert](https://www.facebook.com/crimsondesert)\n» Instagram: [https://instagram.com/crimsondesert_](https://instagram.com/crimsondesert_)"
